13aa062b26eb13c0facafbaeaa38c2d2f931f589 Some refactoring and Doxygen documentation work.
02f7e2571880cb02ef526c2e8db7a0d18862033d Update Unix installation instructions.
220b3a57aa7b65bb847bd87ed53c3196af49ecca Fixed ill-formed `#error` preprocessor statements.
8c8a18f74eaceec5229dd52bb56b43ce97cc4be4 Fix GitHub issue #124.
269cc8ecd25cf40a0b6b5d31696dad8c76b36237 Overhauled mechanism for output file gamma default.
8e619b32aafed8cc3302dfd96048faecad189aa0 Eliminate use of `jversion.h`.
089a77c749d140c08e53ee6c04e5988506ddffc7 Added unix/config/compile to .gitignore and unix/prebuild.sh cleanup, (#108)
d41090928a1247d3537268d8406ae7d802936efa Ditching the idea of having unique version numbers for every commit.
a77e8278b726a0bc6c43f339c6e9e85997dae133 Fixing pavement pattern use in functions. (#99)
b4e5a7d05f680429c010c8cc37d7cc1aec7ab5f1 Fix error in previous commit.
a68a23e379b34d90c67ab5e07cff778fa74d65b1 Fix GitHub issue #98, plus a similar problem in the new OBJ import.
2c3b3d628ab754222294b9478adeae9c96743e8f Fix `+A.n` command line option.
01febac3b4cd5627ecd23e8d8e8936380022ce9d Fail more gracefully when encountering an empty `normal{}` statement.
ba309803761009d45d5e2d7c4f017bd61efabe55 A bit more housekeeping.
08262ab314168aef651a8b6a3461680c0b17acb0 Miscellaneous housekeeping.
23f936a657e2c728171a89322a6e5d61b4d34d63 Implemented `potential` pattern and isosurface `polarity` keyword. (#88)
c52c176d584ba92b6e0465ab36e94d0694d359c7 Implemented basic Wavefront OBJ import. (#90)
7d06e7fec16fafe3f7bda1ea2666ea7a6fbaf253 Fixed some parser flaws related to the re-defining of variables.
f1b394a75b2aa1285ef141a70d95db7e6591324f Address some issues in base and core modules found by static code analysis.
01476788169f96721d7add55c58f883feb830506 Help static code analysis tools better understand our code.
3220eb61ccce936b5d21ff518b83943a9c47e475 Relaxed our enforcement of an initial `#version` directive.
486a48f5e59a5b9bf5a2ca28e1854749ebbeda6b Overhauled list of reserved words.
f547721029a9eb110d13efe260d6b36104ac3c34 Fixed a few bugs found by static code analysis.
844234459abe45bad6928009422c0038d3018f98 Fixed minor flaw in Visual Studio project for the VFE module.
04fb97ea1fffa57fcfb9e24782cd253c4bc84b5d FIx Windows build error.
6b6b1b32080fb201ee42750930ec42b6a804a33d Fix unix build errors introduced with the previous commit.

