fbc04c9 2013-11-16 Merge pull request #2 from POV-Ray/3.7-stable
39ce8a2 2013-11-16 Merge pull request #3 from POV-Ray/master
b3846f5 2013-11-17 quiet compiler warnings building with gcc and clang. - define variables and functions as static when not declared by headers. - remove some unused defines. - other minor changes to quiet warnings.
6d3d43e 2013-11-17 Merge pull request #4 from ideasman42/master
b557f95 2013-12-05 eliminate duplicate inclusion of hcmplx.h in backend/math/hcmplx.cpp
63cb736 2013-12-04 Merge pull request #11 from c-lipka/master
8986ec3 2013-12-05 minor whitespace cleanup
cba5bc5 2013-12-06 Account for changes in boost dependencies
227c801 2013-12-05 Merge pull request #13 from yoe/master
9e7e624 2013-12-06 Make sure Makefile.in gets generated properly
d60416f 2013-12-06 Merge pull request #14 from yoe/master
7ae56bc 2013-12-15 Fixing fs#317
c86bd0a 2013-12-16 minor beautifications
51947bd 2013-12-16 fixed two yet unreported bugs: - Iridescence did not properly honor full area diffuse lighting. - Subsurface scattering did not play nice with non-default brilliance values.
1430e54 2013-12-16 require boost >= 1.38
af319dd 2013-12-16 minor improvements in SSLT relating to the storage of precomputed values
a53e090 2013-12-16 more sophisticated way of pulling in the libtiff headers in povray.cpp without breaking the Windows build
c1d54d3 2013-12-16 minor change in how zlib is included in povmscpp.cpp
3c71689 2013-12-16 minor robustness improvement in IFF image reading code
ce3f659 2013-12-16 atmospheric fog, rainbows and sky spheres now use C++ style memory allocation instead of POV_MALLOC
ba9fd68 2013-12-16 eliminated a host of C-style pointer casts, mostly by replacing with C++-style casts
2d12f46 2013-12-16 hotfix for residual issues with FS#270; the artifacts still observed with radiosity abort-continue will now only show in the preview, but not in the generated image file.
956d8ab 2013-12-16 VS2010 kept reporting GUI project to be out of date even if it wasn't; fixed.
278eb39 2013-12-16 preliminary workaround for FS#313 (radiosity.cpp pov::RadiosityFunction::BeforeTile assertion failed)
e703a8b 2013-12-16 various changes related to color computations.
c768ecd 2013-12-16 eliminating some redundant computations in SSLT code
40d9c39 2013-12-16 replaced legacy VECTOR, SNGL_VECT and BBOX_VECT types with Vector3d, new SnglVector3d and new BBoxVector3d types, respectively, in Intersection and Ray classes, in bounding code and a small portion of photons code; also replaced these types in the Blob class except where dictated by the ObjectBase interface; gave old BBOX data type a facelift along the way, throwing out the union and separating it into two separate new types (BoundingBox and MinMaxBoundingBox).
838ce9d 2013-12-16 replaced legacy VECTOR and UV_VECT types with Vector3d and Vector2d, respectively, in ObjectBase interface, objects.h functions, and throughout virtually all of the parser code. Also fixed a few bugs introduced with previous change.
5cee76e 2013-12-16 replaced legacy VECTOR, SNGL_VECT and UV_VECT types with Vector3d, SnglVector3d and Vector2d, respectively, in shapes code, plus other refactoring work in fractal code.
f69d768 2013-12-16 fix for build error introduced with latest change (forgot to commit types.h)
