1430e54d8cab6cc347a604430c34d6929b8bee25 2013-12-16 require boost >= 1.38
af319dd91d9a5bee6da66a7a0050ac8b9ddf5a97 2013-12-16 minor improvements in SSLT relating to the storage of precomputed values
a53e0901308b9be7227a5d7ba92b6737e58467cb 2013-12-16 more sophisticated way of pulling in the libtiff headers in povray.cpp without breaking the Windows build
c1d54d3e528d137cf9aad30e7d046094a90e70b1 2013-12-16 minor change in how zlib is included in povmscpp.cpp
3c71689edd21b40aa0b8a076f6a52b75007eeec1 2013-12-16 minor robustness improvement in IFF image reading code
ce3f65944b046d3985e958b7f2b9474b10d8165b 2013-12-16 atmospheric fog, rainbows and sky spheres now use C++ style memory allocation instead of POV_MALLOC
ba9fd68c46bf14ff94840d460574aa2ba08325b0 2013-12-16 eliminated a host of C-style pointer casts, mostly by replacing with C++-style casts
2d12f4644bffd5bb47db4a6a4b47f309dc8e261c 2013-12-16 hotfix for residual issues with FS#270; the artifacts still observed with radiosity abort-continue will now only show in the preview, but not in the generated image file.
956d8ab881595503c98ff0ce6e7fd76bee8b9557 2013-12-16 VS2010 kept reporting GUI project to be out of date even if it wasn't; fixed.
278eb39016e5738af76c01cd96f866d4da21ea18 2013-12-16 preliminary workaround for FS#313 (radiosity.cpp pov::RadiosityFunction::BeforeTile assertion failed)
e703a8ba133f8845b245565690ba5729bf8ae225 2013-12-16 various changes related to color computations.
c768ecdd15e19e3646b4375aa1cd17a672854854 2013-12-16 eliminating some redundant computations in SSLT code
40d9c39a1d85058fab7e94834166ea2c40d6ba27 2013-12-16 replaced legacy VECTOR, SNGL_VECT and BBOX_VECT types with Vector3d, new SnglVector3d and new BBoxVector3d types, respectively, in Intersection and Ray classes, in bounding code and a small portion of photons code; also replaced these types in the Blob class except where dictated by the ObjectBase interface; gave old BBOX data type a facelift along the way, throwing out the union and separating it into two separate new types (BoundingBox and MinMaxBoundingBox).
838ce9d6328126318601e071cd2424c1d6fc229e 2013-12-16 replaced legacy VECTOR and UV_VECT types with Vector3d and Vector2d, respectively, in ObjectBase interface, objects.h functions, and throughout virtually all of the parser code. Also fixed a few bugs introduced with previous change.
5cee76ecb4ab27b36c7ff026ed34d99255440ff5 2013-12-16 replaced legacy VECTOR, SNGL_VECT and UV_VECT types with Vector3d, SnglVector3d and Vector2d, respectively, in shapes code, plus other refactoring work in fractal code.
f69d768da2fe391682f600ece1f754d9854d6bae 2013-12-16 fix for build error introduced with latest change (forgot to commit types.h)
