7807b5350e341ca11a35b8550e35972b7749d9ed 2013-12-16 added header files to hold Unix flavor-specific config settings; also thrown out the unused fseek64 macro from both Unix and Windows syspovconfig.h; should fix GitHub issue #9.
a417f975d034afdb719e7dd23615a8d708ad461a 2013-12-16 eliminate uint type from platform-independent code; fixes GitHub issue #10
c69dd33be7229c0b427ffed9d76e814b4c7e5468 2013-12-16 now using std::tr1 smart pointers if available, or boost's implementation otherwise; we're using <boost/tr1/memory.hpp> to pull in either. Should fix GitHub issue #8.
