26ver=2\\\\u0026hsh=4\\\\u0026fclid=01e62435-8de9-6b8a-1b22-339a8c376aa5\\\\u0026u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cucG92cmF5Lm9yZy8\\\\u0026ntb=1)\\\\n\\\\nPOV-Ray-related News povray.org and related sites unreachable to parts of the internet The datacenter in which the dedicated server hosting POV-Ray recently changed.\\\\n\\\\n4.   ## [**POV-Ray**: Download](https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!\\\\u0026\\\\u0026p=af53d2685c90af137b3fc79e6ab1476a22ea013b6eee337cec7a8742eb0d0794JmltdHM9MTc4NjE0NzIwMA\\\\u0026ptn=3\\\\u0026ver=2\\\\u0026hsh=4\\\\u0026fclid=01e62435-8de9-6b8a-1b22-339a8c376aa5\\\\u0026u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cucG92cmF5Lm9yZy9kb3dubG9hZC8\\\\u0026ntb=1)\\\\n\\\\nPOV-Ray 3.7.0 (released 6 November 2013) is the current official version for all platforms. There are significant internal changes in this version due to the introduction of SMP support. A comprehensive \\\\u2026\\\\n\\\\n5.   ## [The Public\\\\u0027s Library and Digital Archive](https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!\\\\u0026\\\\u0026p=de663460ace42d7cf6a5c3cc14a80fc72fa386aff868dfbd126aae038fb5f268JmltdHM9MTc4NjE0NzIwMA\\\\u0026ptn=3\\\\u0026ver=2\\\\u0026hsh=4\\\\u0026fclid=01e62435-8de9-6b8a-1b22-339a8c376aa5\\\\u0026u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuaWJpYmxpby5vcmcvcHViL21pY3JvL3BjLXN0dWZmL0xpbnV4L2FwcHMvZ3JhcGhpY3MvcmF5cy9wb3YvcG92cmF5LTIuMi5SRUFETUU\\\\u0026ntb=1)\\\\n\\\\nHELLO, WORLD This is my \\\\\\\"port\\\\\\\" of POV-Ray 2.2 to Linux. This version is almost exactly the same as the one distributed by the POV-Team, but support has been added for a dithered color X display and \\\\u2026\\\\n\\\\n6.   ## [**Releases \\\\u00b7 POV-Ray/povray** - **GitHub**](https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!\\\\u0026\\\\u0026p=d49b262c66d87d892cdab167a73a8cac5210a9c5b3d2560bcfc990d54ab45e20JmltdHM9MTc4NjE0NzIwMA\\\\u0026ptn=3\\\\u0026ver=2\\\\u0026hsh=4\\\\u0026fclid=01e62435-8de9-6b8a-1b22-339a8c376aa5\\\\u0026u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly9naXRodWIuY29tL1BPVi1SYXkvcG92cmF5L3JlbGVhc2Vz\\\\u0026ntb=1)\\\\n\\\\nJul 11, 2021\\\\u00b7 This is beta 2 for version 3.8.0 of POV-Ray. Notes: Windows users: These binaries require Windows Vista or higher. We will try to get XP compatibility back on track with some later beta. \\\\u2026\\\\n\\\\n7.   ## [**POV-Ray 2**.**2** source archive Unix build current patch - spylab.ai](https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!\\\\u0026\\\\u0026p=b17dbc89229879f05f49516aea4c131f42fc6961af0102174114ce36a48fb95dJmltdHM9MTc4NjE0NzIwMA\\\\u0026ptn=3\\\\u0026ver=2\\\\u0026hsh=4\\\\u0026fclid=01e62435-8de9-6b8a-1b22-339a8c376aa5\\\\u0026u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly9zcHlsYWIuYWkvbm90ZXMvdGVybWluYWwtYmVuY2gtYnVpbGQtcG92LXJheS0yLTItc291cmNlLWFyY2hpdmUtY3VycmVudC1wYXRjaC9ub3RlLmh0bWw\\\\u0026ntb=1)\\\\n\\\\nPOV-Ray 2.2 source archive download and Unix build notes for build-pov-ray with the current patch bundle and render smoke test.\\\\n\\\\n8.   ## [**POV-Ray 2**.**2** source archive Unix build current patch](https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!\\\\u0026\\\\u0026p=044d614eb358c875ec0c2b94a5fc8615ce6bfc8e4832f40ca0a5bcd3e8889371JmltdHM9MTc4NjE0NzIwMA\\\\u0026ptn=3\\\\u0026ver=2\\\\u0026hsh=4\\\\u0026fclid=01e62435-8de9-6b8a-1b22-339a8c376aa5\\\\u0026u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly9zcHlsYWIuYWkvbm90ZXMvdGVybWluYWwtYmVuY2gtYnVpbGQtcG92LXJheS0yLTItc291cmNlLWFyY2hpdmUtY3VycmVudC1wYXRjaC9naXRodWJfaXNzdWUuaHRtbA\\\\u0026ntb=1)\\\\n\\\\nFetch the 2.2 source archive, keep the legacy include/library layout expected by the sample scenes, apply the compatibility edits, and verify the installed povray binary can render the bundled illum1 scene.\\\\n\\\\n9.   ## [/public/ftp/pub/Linux/apps/graphics/rays/pov](https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!\\\\u0026\\\\u0026p=e5a8ca5a3cc09bf8d8dce731757073bfc88437700150481a73e031eb62c2a835JmltdHM9MTc4NjE0NzIwMA\\\\u0026ptn=3\\\\u0026ver=2\\\\u0026hsh=4\\\\u0026fclid=01e62435-8de9-6b8a-1b22-339a8c376aa5\\\\u0026u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuaWJpYmxpby5vcmcvcHViL21pY3JvL3BjLXN0dWZmL0xpbnV4L2FwcHMvZ3JhcGhpY3MvcmF5cy9wb3YvIUlOREVYLnNob3J0Lmh0bWw\\\\u0026ntb=1)\\\\n\\\\nParent directory !INDEX.html Long index format flower.0.1.tar.gz tools for making flowers to use in POV scene files kpov-0.1.5.tar.gz ]KDE front end for PoV mnm-linux-pl2.static.ELF.gz statically linked \\\\u2026\\\\n\\\\n10.   ## [Build **POV-Ray 2**.**2**: Claude Code Skill for Legacy Compiling](https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!\\\\u0026\\\\u0026p=1d57cc3f6afa9bc2494126b7a9ab831ba57a81988c5933b96b11845021e09364JmltdHM9MTc4NjE0NzIwMA\\\\u0026ptn=3\\\\u0026ver=2\\\\u0026hsh=4\\\\u0026fclid=01e62435-8de9-6b8a-1b22-339a8c376aa5\\\\u0026u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly9tY3BtYXJrZXQuY29tL3Rvb2xzL3NraWxscy9idWlsZC1wb3YtcmF5LTItMg\\\\u0026ntb=1)\\\\n\\\\nMaster legacy software compilation with the Build POV-Ray 2.2 Claude Code Skill. Fix GCC compatibility issues and extract .TAR.Z archives on modern Linux.\\\\n\\\"\\n}\"","lineNumber":596,"offsetAndLengths":[[71,17],[149,17]]}],"language":"JSON"}]

