FILE machine/ibmpc/watcom/ibmwat3.lnk STATUS added RAW https://github.com/acekiller/povray/raw/73cd17f34ec15ab013bdccc64d883fdda4eb2f32/machine%2Fibmpc%2Fwatcom%2Fibmwat3.lnk
